          <name>NRX_FREQUENCY_CONTROL</name>
          <description>SOURCE[ROM_REV0_PHY_FREQUENCY_CHANNEL]; CONFIDENCE[instruction-exact-multifunction]. NRX initialization and frequency quotient word. Complete phy_nrx_freq_set samples and preserves the high byte, clears bits 23:20, and writes a twenty-bit quotient.</description>
          <addressOffset>0x7848</addressOffset><size>32</size><access>read-write</access>
          <fields>
            <field><name>FREQUENCY_QUOTIENT_OR_INIT_LOW_UNKNOWN</name><bitOffset>0</bitOffset><bitWidth>20</bitWidth></field>
